WEBVTT

00:37.579 --> 00:41.875
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

02:21.891 --> 02:23.476
Please don't kill us.

02:43.413 --> 02:46.249
Please don't kill us.

02:48.668 --> 02:50.587
What in the world happened here?

02:58.970 --> 03:00.805
Is this my doing?

03:35.798 --> 03:41.638
Hurray for the independence of Korea!

03:56.236 --> 03:57.612
Gyeongseong will now…

04:01.199 --> 04:03.159
welcome a new spring.

04:17.590 --> 04:19.008
But my winter

04:20.510 --> 04:22.011
has not ended yet.

04:36.401 --> 04:39.737
Left behind by myself
in this perfect hell…

04:44.492 --> 04:46.452
I was forgotten by all.

04:51.374 --> 04:52.208
But…

04:57.505 --> 04:58.673
why?

04:59.674 --> 05:01.801
Why are these things happening again?

05:06.806 --> 05:07.890
Master Jang.

05:09.517 --> 05:12.437
How is it that you are here?

05:32.832 --> 05:33.750
Hey?

05:34.959 --> 05:36.836
I think you're hugging the wrong guy.

05:40.673 --> 05:41.841
Who is Master Jang?

05:44.177 --> 05:46.095
I'm afraid I don't know who that is.

05:55.688 --> 05:57.440
You're not Master Jang?

05:57.523 --> 05:58.524
I'm not.

06:00.026 --> 06:01.361
My name is Jang Ho-jae.

06:11.204 --> 06:12.288
Are you all right?

06:14.082 --> 06:15.458
Why did I do that?

06:16.751 --> 06:18.252
It simply isn't possible.

06:18.795 --> 06:19.712
Excuse me.

06:21.839 --> 06:23.257
There's no way it could be him.

06:24.801 --> 06:25.885
Hey!

06:30.181 --> 06:31.140
Wait.

06:33.684 --> 06:35.061
You haven't answered me yet.

06:39.732 --> 06:40.566
About what?

06:40.650 --> 06:42.485
About who you are,

06:43.069 --> 06:46.322
why you were there that day,
and your relationship with Oh Ki-hoon.

06:46.406 --> 06:49.367
And why do I have to tell you any of that?

06:49.450 --> 06:51.369
Because I'm about to take the fall

06:52.495 --> 06:56.124
and become a murder suspect,
all because I got mixed up with you.

06:57.875 --> 07:00.753
So can you tell me why you were there?

07:04.048 --> 07:05.341
I received a request

07:06.092 --> 07:07.677
to find a missing person.

07:08.428 --> 07:11.180
I went to the motel to find Oh Ki-hoon,

07:11.806 --> 07:13.474
who was already dead when I arrived.

07:15.059 --> 07:16.769
So you're in the same boat as me?

07:16.853 --> 07:18.479
I wouldn't exactly say that.

07:19.147 --> 07:20.648
You're a suspect, and I'm not.

07:22.942 --> 07:24.944
The police also have you on video.

07:27.613 --> 07:29.782
You'll be on the wanted list soon enough.

07:29.866 --> 07:30.992
So?

07:32.910 --> 07:34.328
Want to be on the same side?

07:35.830 --> 07:37.832
You're not the culprit, and neither am I,

07:38.332 --> 07:41.419
but both of us are
under suspicion by the police.

07:41.502 --> 07:42.670
We must help each other.

07:43.254 --> 07:45.465
That's an arrogant way to ask for help.

07:46.883 --> 07:49.051
Because there's no downside
to being on my side.

07:49.844 --> 07:52.513
I don't want to sound like I'm bragging,

07:52.597 --> 07:56.601
but you could say
I'm quite the hotshot in this field.

07:57.602 --> 07:58.978
I work alone.

08:00.897 --> 08:02.815
I hate getting tangled up with others.

08:05.318 --> 08:08.362
I also don't like getting tangled up
with others, but hey,

08:09.822 --> 08:11.991
a person has died.

08:15.578 --> 08:17.121
I don't take second punches.

08:21.959 --> 08:22.877
A word of advice?

08:24.253 --> 08:27.215
Even if you find the killer,
you won't be able to handle them.

08:27.298 --> 08:29.967
I'll be the judge
of whether I can handle them or not.

08:30.051 --> 08:31.177
Go for it, then.

08:32.345 --> 08:34.263
And don't ask me for a free ride.

08:34.347 --> 08:35.515
A free ride?

08:35.598 --> 08:37.558
Who? Me?

08:37.642 --> 08:38.559
Exactly.

08:40.478 --> 08:43.481
Let's mind our own business
and deal with our problems on our own.

09:24.564 --> 09:28.025
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN FACT AND DISTORTION

09:28.109 --> 09:31.487
EPISODE 2
SIGN

09:34.198 --> 09:36.409
You're back? So, what happened?

09:36.993 --> 09:38.494
Did you find the woman?

09:38.578 --> 09:40.955
Don't talk to me. I'm not in the mood.

09:46.252 --> 09:48.254
Yong-gil, do you know a Master Jang?

09:50.006 --> 09:50.840
Who?

09:50.923 --> 09:52.216
Master Jang.

09:52.800 --> 09:54.677
No, it doesn't ring a bell.

09:55.553 --> 09:56.387
Why?

09:56.470 --> 09:58.681
That woman asked me if I was Master Jang.

09:59.557 --> 10:00.391
So?

10:00.975 --> 10:02.476
I told her I wasn't,

10:03.644 --> 10:05.146
but it sounded familiar.

10:05.229 --> 10:07.648
I thought maybe I'd heard it
from you or something.

10:08.566 --> 10:09.483
From me?

10:10.651 --> 10:12.778
Probably not. I've never heard it before.

10:14.405 --> 10:17.158
I'm making instant noodles.
Want some? I can add more water.

10:17.241 --> 10:18.159
No, I'm good.

10:45.478 --> 10:47.438
Hi, Bugang Company's Jang Ho-jae speaking.

10:50.608 --> 10:51.692
Who is this?

11:56.757 --> 11:57.842
Job request.

11:57.925 --> 12:01.929
Missing person's name, Jang Ho-jae.
Age, early 30s.

12:02.012 --> 12:04.265
He's been missing for about a year.

12:05.099 --> 12:07.727
There is no photograph, only a drawing.

12:07.810 --> 12:08.728
Do you accept?

12:41.469 --> 12:42.511
Here you go.

12:43.179 --> 12:44.096
Thank you.

12:50.644 --> 12:52.062
Ethiopian, huh?

12:52.146 --> 12:53.105
Paraguayan.

12:56.317 --> 12:59.153
I actually don't know coffee that well.
I just took a guess.

12:59.236 --> 13:01.822
I don't know it well either.
I just read the label.

13:05.034 --> 13:07.912
I assume you're not here
to find out my taste in coffee.

13:08.412 --> 13:10.331
Let's cut to the chase. What do you want?

13:11.040 --> 13:12.041
Actually…

13:16.921 --> 13:18.464
I'm here to give you this.

13:19.840 --> 13:20.883
JONGNO-GU SERIAL MURDER

13:20.966 --> 13:23.636
CASE REPORT

13:25.471 --> 13:28.724
These murders occurred in our jurisdiction
in the past two months.

13:28.808 --> 13:31.936
Mr. Oh Ki-hoon was the fifth victim.

13:32.561 --> 13:35.940
The same MO was used in all five cases.

13:36.023 --> 13:39.985
When the bodies were found,
they were missing an eye and their brain.

13:40.069 --> 13:40.986
Brain?

13:42.905 --> 13:44.156
Like the one inside here?

13:44.240 --> 13:48.202
To be honest, we've never seen
this kind of murder before,

13:48.285 --> 13:51.205
so even the detectives are a bit baffled.

13:51.288 --> 13:55.626
We haven't even figured out
what was used to suck out the brain.

13:57.253 --> 13:59.922
Are you saying
this was all done by one person?

14:00.673 --> 14:03.300
Yes. It's the work of a single killer.

14:08.055 --> 14:09.223
Still no reply?

14:11.100 --> 14:13.853
If you're busy,
you can leave a number and go.

14:14.353 --> 14:16.355
I'll text you
when a decision has been made.

14:17.398 --> 14:19.608
How long have you been working
with Silverbill?

14:22.945 --> 14:25.322
I don't take any questions
regarding Silverbill.

14:26.115 --> 14:28.284
I only take requests
to find missing persons.

14:29.076 --> 14:30.286
The request for Ki-hoon…

14:32.413 --> 14:33.956
are you the one who took it?

14:42.715 --> 14:43.966
So this bar

14:45.551 --> 14:47.136
is the reception, so to speak.

14:49.722 --> 14:50.556
Right?

15:04.737 --> 15:06.697
- I'M HEADING OVER NOW
- DON'T COME

15:18.500 --> 15:21.545
I'm curious. What is the meaning of this?

15:21.629 --> 15:24.757
You must've given me the details
of the investigation for a reason.

15:24.840 --> 15:26.133
It's only fair.

15:26.216 --> 15:29.428
You should at least know
what kind of case you're jumping into

15:29.511 --> 15:32.681
and how dangerous
and horrific this culprit is.

15:33.182 --> 15:34.767
This is the least I can do.

15:35.476 --> 15:36.894
Are you new to Violent Crimes?

15:36.977 --> 15:38.395
I transferred two months ago.

15:38.479 --> 15:39.939
How many cases have you solved?

15:40.022 --> 15:41.941
Just a couple of small-time ones.

15:42.024 --> 15:43.901
Yet they gave you a serial murder case?

15:43.984 --> 15:47.613
I can't pick and choose the cases I take.
I'm just following orders.

15:47.696 --> 15:49.490
Then why stick that on there?

15:54.078 --> 15:57.623
A pretty noticeable spot, don't you think?

16:01.835 --> 16:02.670
I'm sorry.

16:02.753 --> 16:05.172
No worries. Did I startle you?

16:05.255 --> 16:06.090
Yes.

16:09.259 --> 16:11.387
ANOTHER VICTIM FOUND
ALL DETECTIVES TO THE CRIME SCENE

16:11.470 --> 16:14.765
It's another murder.
This is the sixth one already.

16:15.265 --> 16:17.226
- Let's go together.
- What?

16:49.591 --> 16:51.176
We ask for your cooperation.

16:51.677 --> 16:54.513
Back up. Do not take pictures.
Back up, please.

16:56.348 --> 16:57.349
Back up, please.

16:59.309 --> 17:01.228
Stop. This is a crime scene. Step back.

17:01.311 --> 17:02.312
Has anyone been hurt?

17:02.396 --> 17:03.647
This is a crime scene.

17:04.231 --> 17:05.607
Please move. Clear the way.

17:19.788 --> 17:20.998
This is driving me nuts.

17:23.459 --> 17:25.419
I didn't think this would happen to her.

17:26.086 --> 17:27.171
I know, right?

17:30.799 --> 17:32.926
She was so good to me.

17:50.069 --> 17:51.111
MADAM NA

18:10.339 --> 18:11.340
Who are you?

18:13.884 --> 18:15.302
How do you know Jang Ho-jae?

18:17.930 --> 18:19.348
Did you kill Madam Na?

18:21.934 --> 18:24.394
I asked her things,
but she kept talking nonsense.

18:24.978 --> 18:25.896
So yeah.

18:30.943 --> 18:32.486
You crazy bastard.

18:34.279 --> 18:35.405
Where are you?

18:38.450 --> 18:40.160
Tell me where you are right now.

18:40.661 --> 18:42.788
- I asked you a question.
- No pictures.

18:42.871 --> 18:44.540
You should be answering me.

18:44.623 --> 18:47.292
Move out of the way. Please move.

18:57.761 --> 18:58.679
Step back.

18:58.762 --> 19:00.806
Step back. This is a crime scene.

19:00.889 --> 19:01.723
Back up.

19:07.771 --> 19:10.023
Thank you.
I got here quicker thanks to you.

22:01.028 --> 22:02.112
That's odd.

22:04.406 --> 22:05.407
Why won't you die?

22:05.991 --> 22:07.409
Shouldn't you be dead by now

22:07.993 --> 22:10.579
with your neck broken
or your insides ruptured?

22:13.081 --> 22:14.458
If you're human, that is.

22:20.881 --> 22:22.215
Who the hell are you?

22:23.342 --> 22:24.718
Why did you kill Madam Na?

22:25.594 --> 22:28.764
Did you kill Oh Ki-hoon too?
Are you the one behind all of this?

22:32.768 --> 22:33.602
You…

22:35.896 --> 22:36.897
You're one of us.

23:10.806 --> 23:11.723
Let's find out.

23:16.520 --> 23:17.562
Who the fuck are you?

23:20.065 --> 23:21.483
Hey, are you all right?

23:21.566 --> 23:22.401
Are you hurt…

23:29.366 --> 23:31.785
Hello? Someone's been stabbed.

23:31.868 --> 23:33.453
Get here now!

23:41.753 --> 23:42.629
Are you okay?

23:43.213 --> 23:46.383
Hold on a little longer.
The ambulance is on its way.

23:47.551 --> 23:49.553
Hey!

23:50.095 --> 23:52.848
You have to stay awake. Hey!

23:54.975 --> 23:57.477
Stay with me. Hey!

24:14.119 --> 24:15.287
Did you get some sleep?

24:22.502 --> 24:24.921
You were sleeping so peacefully.

24:25.547 --> 24:27.090
I didn't want to wake you.

24:35.891 --> 24:37.017
Master Jang.

24:42.022 --> 24:42.939
What's wrong?

24:43.648 --> 24:46.651
Did you have a bad dream?

24:53.033 --> 24:54.993
It was a wretched dream.

24:59.706 --> 25:01.249
A terrifying…

25:05.378 --> 25:06.338
and lonely one.

25:10.759 --> 25:13.678
A dream is just a dream.

25:15.514 --> 25:17.140
Don't think too much of it.

25:27.108 --> 25:29.528
Don't worry. I'm not going anywhere.

25:30.987 --> 25:32.197
I will be here

25:33.323 --> 25:34.950
by your side forever.

26:07.524 --> 26:10.360
Let him go. You're bleeding too much.
We need to treat you now.

26:59.075 --> 27:00.368
Yes, Mr. Chairman.

27:00.452 --> 27:01.828
No, I'm on Level 1.

27:03.997 --> 27:04.914
Pardon?

27:07.208 --> 27:08.126
Last night?

27:13.506 --> 27:17.218
JAZZ BAR OWNER IN HER 40S MURDERED
BODY FOUND WITH DAMAGED EYE

27:17.802 --> 27:19.804
I'll look into it and see what happened.

27:20.930 --> 27:23.933
No. Don't concern yourself.
I'll make sure it's taken care of.

27:24.017 --> 27:24.893
Yes.

27:29.522 --> 27:30.732
Call Seung-jo.

27:31.483 --> 27:32.942
Yes, sir.

28:02.430 --> 28:04.557
Do you know
where the emergency patient went?

28:04.641 --> 28:06.142
No, I haven't seen her.

28:08.436 --> 28:10.855
How did it go? Is she all right?

28:11.564 --> 28:13.566
I'm afraid she's disappeared.

28:14.150 --> 28:16.611
We're searching
the whole building right now,

28:18.154 --> 28:21.199
but it seems like she's left the hospital.

28:21.866 --> 28:22.742
What?

28:24.285 --> 28:25.286
What are you…

28:42.721 --> 28:44.597
Is a roundup really necessary?

28:47.767 --> 28:49.728
Scare tactics are a bit outdated--

29:11.958 --> 29:15.086
Do not cause trouble again.
Do not act on your own.

29:15.170 --> 29:19.132
It's because I acted on my own
that I took care of that bastard Ki-hoon.

29:19.924 --> 29:21.009
You know that!

29:21.092 --> 29:23.887
When I'm talking, you listen.

29:23.970 --> 29:25.889
Isn't it frustrating to live like this?

29:26.389 --> 29:28.475
How long are you going to stay in hiding?

29:29.309 --> 29:32.103
With our powers,
we can live however we want!

29:35.732 --> 29:39.736
Power that cannot be controlled
is not real power, Seung-jo.

29:41.070 --> 29:44.115
That's chaotic inertia and violence,
nothing more.

29:46.409 --> 29:48.870
Don't let me hear a peep from you
for a while.

29:50.288 --> 29:52.707
And don't do anything

29:52.791 --> 29:55.835
until the incidents
that you've caused die down.

29:58.922 --> 30:00.423
Make one more mess,

30:00.507 --> 30:03.593
and you'll have to explain yourself
directly to the chairman.

30:04.636 --> 30:06.137
If you'd like that, be my guest.

30:13.102 --> 30:14.938
Are you sure he's dead?

30:16.981 --> 30:18.024
Ho-jae.

30:20.193 --> 30:22.070
Is he really dead?

30:33.623 --> 30:34.499
Seung-jo.

30:35.083 --> 30:37.252
Don't ever bring that name up again.

30:38.294 --> 30:39.337
I'll gut you.

30:45.844 --> 30:48.137
JONGNO POLICE STATION

30:51.015 --> 30:52.725
This makes the sixth victim.

30:54.018 --> 30:55.603
And the culprit left no trace.

30:56.437 --> 31:00.108
None of the victims are related,
save for the way they were murdered.

31:00.191 --> 31:01.276
No patterns either.

31:08.992 --> 31:10.952
Did you glean anything on your end?

31:12.745 --> 31:13.663
Detective Noh.

31:14.706 --> 31:15.707
Noh Ji-su?

31:18.459 --> 31:19.627
Did you get anything?

31:20.211 --> 31:22.130
No, nothing that stands out so far.

31:22.213 --> 31:24.591
- So?
- What?

31:24.674 --> 31:28.428
So why are you sitting there
if you haven't found anything?

31:28.970 --> 31:32.265
Didn't I tell you
to keep an eye on Jang Ho-jae?

31:33.057 --> 31:35.768
No one told you to sit your ass down
and listen to music.

31:39.480 --> 31:40.565
I'll be off, then.

31:51.200 --> 31:53.411
He's not home yet?

32:16.684 --> 32:20.188
Where Silverbill lives?
Well, I wouldn't know that.

32:21.105 --> 32:23.483
I doubt even Madam Na knew that much.

32:28.446 --> 32:30.865
They used text messages for communication.

32:31.866 --> 32:34.786
They'd only call each other
when it was urgent.

32:35.787 --> 32:38.790
No one's ever met Silverbill
or seen their face.

32:43.795 --> 32:45.213
Why is this place so bleak?

32:50.259 --> 32:53.262
They say you can never tell
what life has in store for you.

32:53.346 --> 32:55.682
Who would've thought
Madam Na would die like that?

33:08.236 --> 33:09.320
This is too much!

33:09.404 --> 33:12.782
You said your grandson just graduated.
Get him some nice clothes.

33:15.827 --> 33:18.621
Speaking of, he applied for a job recently

33:18.705 --> 33:22.583
and passed everything,
even the interview, all in one go!

33:23.251 --> 33:24.335
He's got a job already?

33:24.919 --> 33:27.380
He's going to work at Jeonseung Biotech!

33:30.049 --> 33:32.301
I was planning on buying him a nice suit.

33:33.761 --> 33:34.971
Thanks, President Jang.

33:35.680 --> 33:37.265
Yong-gil's the president.

33:37.348 --> 33:38.349
Whatever!

33:38.433 --> 33:42.353
All of us antennas know that Master Jang
is the one keeping Bugang afloat.

33:48.526 --> 33:49.360
Who?

33:50.903 --> 33:51.738
What?

33:54.824 --> 33:57.326
What did you just call me?

33:58.703 --> 33:59.787
Oh, well…

34:01.956 --> 34:05.668
there used to be a pawnshop
where your office is right now.

34:05.752 --> 34:07.295
House of Golden Treasure.

34:07.879 --> 34:10.381
He was the owner of that pawnshop.

34:10.465 --> 34:14.260
He was such a good man,
even back during my mother's days.

34:17.055 --> 34:18.097
Right, so,

34:19.807 --> 34:20.641
who was he?

34:22.101 --> 34:23.144
Just some guy.

34:24.937 --> 34:26.022
Master Jang.

34:29.400 --> 34:30.526
Master Jang.

35:06.104 --> 35:08.856
That is the result of Experiment A0-67.

35:09.607 --> 35:11.442
How far did we progress this time?

35:11.943 --> 35:14.362
We weren't able to pass Stage 2 again.

35:35.007 --> 35:36.008
Don't panic.

35:36.092 --> 35:39.929
The moment it recognizes
that you're frightened, it'll attack you.

36:21.304 --> 36:22.972
Don't move. Stand your ground.

36:30.897 --> 36:32.481
Please help me!

36:32.565 --> 36:34.233
Don't look away. Keep still.

36:34.817 --> 36:36.986
I can't do this! I can't!

37:07.266 --> 37:10.269
How long do you intend
to shove failed reports at me?

37:10.811 --> 37:15.566
If you can't control those down there,
we can't proceed to the next stage.

37:16.234 --> 37:19.070
If you continue to show no results
and lag like this,

37:19.904 --> 37:22.490
we might have to bring him back.

37:23.866 --> 37:25.368
I will find a solution.

37:25.451 --> 37:28.955
The previous chairman planted
the Najin in your head

37:29.455 --> 37:31.374
so you could protect Jeonseung

37:31.958 --> 37:34.710
and devote yourself
to making great accomplishments.

37:35.836 --> 37:38.923
If you can't stop making
these absurd mistakes and failures,

37:40.258 --> 37:43.010
I will dispose of you.
You should not forget that.

37:44.345 --> 37:45.680
I have not forgotten, sir.

37:46.681 --> 37:48.015
Not for a single moment.

37:58.150 --> 37:59.277
What about Seung-jo?

38:00.027 --> 38:02.863
I've spoken to him.
He will behave for the time being.

38:02.947 --> 38:06.659
Tell him he'll be locked up forever
if he stirs up trouble one more time.

38:08.452 --> 38:09.787
I mean, murder?

38:10.579 --> 38:12.248
In this day and age?

38:48.909 --> 38:51.787
Eat up, man.
It's getting all soggy. What a waste.

38:55.499 --> 38:58.502
This place used to be a pawnshop.
The House of Golden Treasure.

38:59.879 --> 39:00.755
Is that right?

39:02.173 --> 39:04.008
It was owned by a Master Jang.

39:13.059 --> 39:15.478
Granny Antenna knew about it.
Didn't you know?

39:17.188 --> 39:20.608
Not sure.
I might've heard about it and forgot.

39:23.319 --> 39:24.320
What now?

39:26.447 --> 39:27.698
I'm just asking.

39:28.407 --> 39:30.826
Is there anything more
I should know about myself

39:31.744 --> 39:33.412
before the accident last year?

39:35.039 --> 39:36.123
No, there isn't.

39:36.749 --> 39:39.502
I told you pretty much everything
you need to know. Why?

39:40.086 --> 39:41.420
What else do you wanna know?

39:41.921 --> 39:44.757
I wouldn't know
what more there is to know.

39:46.133 --> 39:50.346
What I remember about myself
all comes from after the accident.

39:51.180 --> 39:54.141
My memories from before the accident
were filled in by you.

39:59.688 --> 40:01.148
Ho-jae, do you trust me?

40:01.732 --> 40:02.566
I do.

40:02.650 --> 40:05.903
And no one in this world worries
and cares for you as much as I do, right?

40:06.612 --> 40:07.530
Yeah, I know that.

40:07.613 --> 40:09.115
So just listen to me.

40:09.907 --> 40:13.077
You're much better off now
than you were before the accident.

40:15.579 --> 40:18.874
It's not always great
to live with all your memories intact.

40:19.375 --> 40:23.421
Looking at you, I can see why they say
oblivion is a gift to mankind.

40:23.504 --> 40:25.172
Your life's already been reset,

40:25.256 --> 40:28.050
so it doesn't seem so bad
to move on and live a new life.

40:31.720 --> 40:33.055
Was my life that bad?

40:33.848 --> 40:35.766
You're making it serious again!

40:35.850 --> 40:37.518
That's not what I'm saying.

40:37.601 --> 40:41.397
You said I should move on
and live a new life since it's been reset.

40:41.480 --> 40:44.650
That means that my life
before the accident was unhappy

40:45.693 --> 40:47.570
or screwed up or something, right?

40:48.696 --> 40:51.365
The accident happened,
and you lost your memories--

40:51.449 --> 40:53.367
Yes, about those memories…

40:57.413 --> 40:58.330
I want them back.

40:59.790 --> 41:00.624
Ho-jae.

41:03.627 --> 41:04.628
Can you tell me?

41:06.714 --> 41:08.048
What was I like?

41:09.800 --> 41:11.969
I mean, how screwed up was I?

41:14.096 --> 41:15.014
Come on.

41:18.559 --> 41:19.477
Your life?

41:21.228 --> 41:24.982
It was totally, extremely,
freaking annoyingly screwed up.

41:26.150 --> 41:28.277
It was depressing, miserable, and unhappy.

41:29.528 --> 41:30.863
Totally and extremely lame.

41:30.946 --> 41:35.034
You were a step away from hell, strung out
with paranoia, anxiety, and insomnia.

41:35.117 --> 41:38.913
You'd cause trouble and smash everything
because you had anger management issues.

41:38.996 --> 41:42.291
So there's no reason at all
for you to look back at your past life.

41:42.374 --> 41:44.460
There's nothing to be curious about.

41:44.543 --> 41:45.711
What you should do

41:46.545 --> 41:50.257
is believe, see, think of, and enjoy
only what's in front of you.

41:50.341 --> 41:52.259
There's jajangmyeon in front of you,

41:52.343 --> 41:54.678
and all you have to do is enjoy it.

42:14.281 --> 42:17.201
You must've had a really hard time.

42:19.286 --> 42:20.371
Hey, Ho-jae.

42:21.997 --> 42:23.374
UNKNOWN NUMBER

42:24.416 --> 42:25.292
Hello?

42:29.129 --> 42:30.005
Hello?

42:31.131 --> 42:32.049
It's me.

42:33.259 --> 42:34.134
Where are you?

42:34.843 --> 42:37.096
How's your injury? Are you okay?

42:38.472 --> 42:40.140
Can I come in for a minute?

42:43.852 --> 42:44.687
What…

42:55.948 --> 42:57.116
What happened?

42:59.577 --> 43:00.744
Your offer.

43:03.205 --> 43:04.206
Does it still stand?

43:06.667 --> 43:08.502
To be on the same side.

43:11.839 --> 43:13.340
I'm wondering if it still stands.

44:39.885 --> 44:40.761
Hello?
